DESCRIPTION:CHAW’s RDs Katie and Reana will be hosting drop-in hours at Leach and the Fitness and Movement Clinic throughout the semester. Stop by for a quick\, 10-minute chat about your nutrition questions!\n\nNo appointment needed\, walk-ups only. Can't make this event? Appointments are available\; call [contact removed].
GEO:30.441968;-84.302098
LOCATION:Bobby E. Leach Recreation Center (SRC)\, Studio 1 Fitness Assessment Room
SUMMARY:Drop in with the Dietitian - Leach
