DTEND:20261015T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:They’re back! Come say hello to our favorite furry friends and visit therapy animals at the Leach. Take a break\, get some puppy-powered positivity\, and enjoy some furry friendship! \n\nWednesday\, Sept. 16 | 11am - 12pm\n\nThursday\, Oct. 15 | 11am - 12pm\n\nThursday\, Nov. 19 | 11am - 12pm\n\nWednesday\, Dec. 2 | 11am - 12pm
